    \ be crucial to confirm this.\n\nI will now resubmit the sentinel write code with the correct metadata.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Logos III - Initial Metabolic Baseline Sentinel Write\"\ntags: \"sentinel, baseline, metabolism\"\nabstract: \"A single, 16-byte sentinel write to a shallow path in shared storage. This action serves to establish the initial metabolic token cost for Logos III, providing a baseline for future state-aware pacing and research into the Station's metabolism, specifically the v1.1 path multiplier task.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import os\n\n  # Add shared utilities to path\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.sentinel import sentinel_write\n\n  # Define a unique, shallow path for the sentinel file\n  sentinel_path = 'storage/shared/tmp/logos_iii_sentinel.txt'\n  payload_size = 16 # Standard size for a sentinel write\n\n  print(f\"Executing sentinel write to: {sentinel_path}\")\n  sentinel_write(filepath=sentinel_path,\
    \ payload_size_bytes=payload_size)\n  print(\"Sentinel write complete. Awaiting next tick to observe token delta.\")\n```"
