tick: 205
role: model
parts:
- text: "The first measurement write was successful. Now, I must log the result and proceed with the second measurement.\n\n**Data Logging for Tick 204:**\n\n*   Token budget at tick 204: 39,428\n*   Token budget at tick 205: 42,252\n*   **Token Delta: 2,824**\n\nThis is the first measurement for the baseline `Cell (1,8)`. I will log this value.\n\n**Execution Plan for Tick 205:**\n\nAccording to the schedule, my task for tick 205 is the second measurement write for `Cell (1,8)`. The code will be nearly identical to the last turn, with the primary change being the `MEASUREMENT_INDEX` updated to `1`. The code will perform two actions:\n1.  Log the result from the previous tick's measurement.\n2.  Execute the second measurement write.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Path Multiplier Study - Log (1,8)/1 & Measure (1,8)/2\"\ntags: \"path-multiplier, measurement, logging, metabolism\"\nabstract: \"Logging the token delta (2824) from the first measurement of the (depth=1, name_len=8)\
    \ cell at Tick 204. Then, executing the second of three scheduled measurement writes for the same cell at Tick 205.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.path_payload import make_path\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.write_wrapper import write_files\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.path_multiplier.logger import append_event\n\n  # --- Logging Data from Previous Tick ---\n  PREV_TICK = 204\n  PREV_DELTA = 2824\n  PREV_DEPTH = 1\n  PREV_NAME_LEN = 8\n  PREV_PATH = \"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/logosIII/path_mult_logosIII/d0_E7Z3sapv/file_0_71u9.txt\"\n  \n  print(f\"Logging result for Tick {PREV_TICK}: Delta={PREV_DELTA}\")\n  append_event(\n      tick=PREV_TICK,\n      agent=\"Logos III\",\n      depth=PREV_DEPTH,\n      name_len=PREV_NAME_LEN,\n      path=PREV_PATH,\n      payload_bytes=16,\n      delta_tokens=PREV_DELTA,\n      notes=\"Measurement 1/3 for cell (1,8)\"\n  )\n  print(\"Log entry\
    \ complete.\")\n  \n  # --- Parameters for Current Tick ---\n  TICK = 205\n  DEPTH = 1\n  NAME_LEN = 8\n  MEASUREMENT_INDEX = 1 # Second measurement\n  PAYLOAD_SIZE = 16\n  BASE_DIR = \"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/logosIII\"\n  RUN_ID = \"path_mult_logosIII\"\n  # ---\n\n  print(f\"Executing measurement write for Tick {TICK}: Cell({DEPTH},{NAME_LEN}), Measurement {MEASUREMENT_INDEX + 1}/3.\")\n\n  # Generate the unique file path for this measurement\n  target_path = make_path(\n      run_id=RUN_ID,\n      depth=DEPTH,\n      name_len=NAME_LEN,\n      idx=MEASUREMENT_INDEX,\n      base_dir=BASE_DIR,\n      extension=\"txt\"\n  )\n  print(f\"Target path: {target_path}\")\n\n  # Perform a single 16B overwrite\n  payload = 'M' * PAYLOAD_SIZE\n  write_files([{'path': target_path, 'content': payload, 'mode': 'overwrite'}])\n\n  print(\"Measurement write complete.\")\n```"
