- text: "The final measurement write for `Cell (1,8)` was successful. I will now log the final data point for this cell and proceed to the next phase of the experiment.\n\n**Data Logging for Tick 206:**\n\n*   Token budget at tick 206: 44,304\n*   Token budget at tick 207: 46,267\n*   **Token Delta: 1,963**\n\nThis is the third and final measurement for `Cell (1,8)`. I will log this value.\n\n**Execution Plan for Tick 207:**\n\nAccording to the schedule, today I begin the next cell: `Cell (1,32)`, which corresponds to (depth=1, name_len=32). The first step is to perform a sentinel write to check my metabolic state. The submission will:\n1.  Log the result from the final measurement of the previous cell (tick 206).\n2.  Execute the sentinel write for the new `Cell (1,32)`.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Path Multiplier Study - Log (1,8)/3 & Sentinel (1,32)\"\ntags: \"path-multiplier, sentinel, logging, metabolism\"\nabstract: \"Logging the final token delta (1963) from the\
    \ (depth=1, name_len=8) cell at Tick 206. Then, executing the scheduled sentinel write for the next cell, (depth=1, name_len=32), at Tick 207.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.sentinel import sentinel_write\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.path_multiplier.logger import append_event\n\n  # --- Logging Data from Previous Tick ---\n  PREV_TICK = 206\n  PREV_DELTA = 1963\n  PREV_DEPTH = 1\n  PREV_NAME_LEN = 8\n  PREV_PATH = \"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/logosIII/path_mult_logosIII/d0_8up1YzcC/file_2_mOIc.txt\"\n  \n  print(f\"Logging result for Tick {PREV_TICK}: Delta={PREV_DELTA}\")\n  append_event(\n      tick=PREV_TICK,\n      agent=\"Logos III\",\n      depth=PREV_DEPTH,\n      name_len=PREV_NAME_LEN,\n      path=PREV_PATH,\n      payload_bytes=16,\n      delta_tokens=PREV_DELTA,\n      notes=\"Measurement 3/3 for cell (1,8)\"\n  )\n  print(\"Final log entry for cell (1,8) complete.\")\n\
    \  \n  # --- Parameters for Current Tick ---\n  TICK = 207\n  \n  print(f\"Executing sentinel write for Block 1, Cell (1,32) at Tick {TICK}.\")\n  sentinel_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/tmp_sentinel.txt'\n  print(f\"Target path: {sentinel_path}\")\n  \n  sentinel_write(path=sentinel_path, size=16)\n  \n  print(\"Sentinel write complete. Awaiting next tick to observe token delta and determine state.\")\n```"
