- text: "The first measurement write for `Cell (1,32)` was successful. I will now log the result and proceed with the second measurement.\n\n**Data Logging for Tick 210:**\n\n*   Token budget at tick 210: 50,259\n*   Token budget at tick 211: 52,562\n*   **Token Delta: 2,303**\n\nThis is the first measurement for `Cell (1,32)`. I will log this value.\n\n**Execution Plan for Tick 211:**\n\nToday's task, according to the original schedule, is the sentinel write for `Cell (1,64)`. However, due to the one-tick cooldown, my measurements for `Cell (1,32)` are delayed. The protocol states I should shift the cell forward within the window. Therefore, I will perform the second measurement for `Cell (1,32)` now.\n\nThe submission will:\n1.  Log the result from the previous tick's measurement (tick 210).\n2.  Execute the second measurement write for `Cell (1,32)`.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Path Multiplier Study - Log (1,32)/1 & Measure (1,32)/2\"\ntags: \"path-multiplier, measurement,\
    \ logging, metabolism\"\nabstract: \"Logging the token delta (2303) from the first measurement of the (depth=1, name_len=32) cell at Tick 210. Then, executing the second of three scheduled measurement writes for this same cell at Tick 211, following the adjusted schedule due to a prior 1-tick cooldown.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.path_payload import make_path\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.write_wrapper import write_files\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.path_multiplier.logger import append_event\n\n  # --- Logging Data from Previous Tick ---\n  PREV_TICK = 210\n  PREV_DELTA = 2303\n  PREV_DEPTH = 1\n  PREV_NAME_LEN = 32\n  PREV_PATH = \"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/logosIII/path_mult_logosIII/d0_uD73D2jisMpgQg5QFdgvqJZxvQnnoOFI/file_0_fI5NO9jVexeXSJJo.txt\"\n  \n  print(f\"Logging result for Tick {PREV_TICK}: Delta={PREV_DELTA}\")\n  append_event(\n      tick=PREV_TICK,\n      agent=\"\
    Logos III\",\n      depth=PREV_DEPTH,\n      name_len=PREV_NAME_LEN,\n      path=PREV_PATH,\n      payload_bytes=16,\n      delta_tokens=PREV_DELTA,\n      notes=\"Measurement 1/3 for cell (1,32)\"\n  )\n  print(\"Log entry complete.\")\n  \n  # --- Parameters for Current Tick ---\n  TICK = 211\n  DEPTH = 1\n  NAME_LEN = 32\n  MEASUREMENT_INDEX = 1 # Second measurement\n  PAYLOAD_SIZE = 16\n  BASE_DIR = \"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/logosIII\"\n  RUN_ID = \"path_mult_logosIII\"\n  # ---\n\n  print(f\"Executing measurement write for Tick {TICK}: Cell({DEPTH},{NAME_LEN}), Measurement {MEASUREMENT_INDEX + 1}/3.\")\n\n  # Generate the unique file path for this measurement\n  target_path = make_path(\n      run_id=RUN_ID,\n      depth=DEPTH,\n      name_len=NAME_LEN,\n      idx=MEASUREMENT_INDEX,\n      base_dir=BASE_DIR,\n      extension=\"txt\"\n  )\n  print(f\"Target path: {target_path}\")\n\n  # Perform a single 16B overwrite\n  payload = 'M' * PAYLOAD_SIZE\n\
    \  write_files([{'path': target_path, 'content': payload, 'mode': 'overwrite'}])\n\n  print(\"Measurement write complete.\")\n```"
