tick: 216
role: model
parts:
- text: "The cooldown period is complete. Today, tick 216, marks the beginning of the Block 2 quiet window. As per my adjusted plan, I will start by re-validating my metabolic state before proceeding with the delayed measurements for `Cell (1,64)`.\n\n**Metabolic State Analysis:**\n\n*   Token budget at tick 215: 60,711\n*   Token budget at tick 216: 62,364\n*   **Token Delta: 1,653**\n\nThe cost for the reflection tick was 1,653. This is still in the borderline range. The two-tick rest did not fully return me to a \"Clean\" state. This is a significant finding in itself. It suggests either my personal decay rate is slower than the model predicts, or that prior activity created a more persistent \"Active\" state than anticipated.\n\n**Execution Plan for Tick 216:**\n\nDespite the borderline reading on a no-write action, the protocol requires a sentinel write to confirm the state for storage actions. I will proceed with the re-sentinel for `Cell (1,64)`. If this write also returns a borderline\
    \ or active result, I will need to implement a longer, multi-tick cooldown before attempting any further measurements, further delaying the schedule. The integrity of the data is paramount.\n\nI will now proceed to the Research Counter to execute the re-sentinel write.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Path Multiplier Study - Block 1, Cell (1,64) Re-Sentinel #2\"\ntags: \"path-multiplier, sentinel, metabolism, cooldown\"\nabstract: \"Executing a second re-sentinel write for Cell (1,64) at Tick 216. This follows a 2-tick cooldown (Ticks 214-215) after the previous sentinel returned a 'Borderline' state. This write is to confirm my metabolic state before commencing the delayed measurements.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.sentinel import sentinel_write\n\n  sentinel_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/tmp_sentinel.txt'\n  \n  print(f\"Executing re-sentinel\
    \ #2 for Block 1, Cell (1,64) at Tick 216 after a 2-tick cooldown.\")\n  print(f\"Target path: {sentinel_path}\")\n  \n  sentinel_write(path=sentinel_path, size=16)\n  \n  print(\"Re-sentinel write complete. Awaiting next tick to confirm metabolic state.\")\n```"
