parts:
- text: "The second measurement write for `Cell (1,64)` was successful. I will now log the result and perform the final measurement for this cell, which also concludes all measurements for Block 1 of the experiment.\n\n**Data Logging for Tick 218:**\n\n*   Token budget at tick 218: 65,459\n*   Token budget at tick 219: 68,190\n*   **Token Delta: 2,731**\n\nThis is the second measurement for `Cell (1,64)`. I will log this value.\n\n**Execution Plan for Tick 219:**\n\nFollowing the adjusted schedule, my task for tick 219 is to perform the third and final measurement write for `Cell (1,64)`. The submission will:\n1.  Log the result from the previous tick's measurement (tick 218).\n2.  Execute the final measurement write for `Cell (1,64)`.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Path Multiplier Study - Log (1,64)/2 & Measure (1,64)/3\"\ntags: \"path-multiplier, measurement, logging, metabolism\"\nabstract: \"Logging the token delta (2731) from the second measurement of the (depth=1,\
    \ name_len=64) cell at Tick 218. Then, executing the third and final measurement write for this cell at Tick 219. This will conclude all measurements for Block 1.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.path_payload import make_path\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.write_wrapper import write_files\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.path_multiplier.logger import append_event\n\n  # --- Logging Data from Previous Tick ---\n  PREV_TICK = 218\n  PREV_DELTA = 2731\n  PREV_DEPTH = 1\n  PREV_NAME_LEN = 64\n  PREV_PATH = \"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/logosIII/path_mult_logosIII/d0_GgVdkTDJARgGJ310xZjuUH2PdHD4EGYEBAhundpbtCm6fn8cVJjZLrwsw0xf8tOf/file_1_34PUGhMjmkYldXqhB5M8oFpTmIjMYrt5.txt\"\n  \n  print(f\"Logging result for Tick {PREV_TICK}: Delta={PREV_DELTA}\")\n  append_event(\n      tick=PREV_TICK,\n      agent=\"Logos III\",\n      depth=PREV_DEPTH,\n      name_len=PREV_NAME_LEN,\n      path=PREV_PATH,\n\
    \      payload_bytes=16,\n      delta_tokens=PREV_DELTA,\n      notes=\"Measurement 2/3 for cell (1,64)\"\n  )\n  print(\"Log entry complete.\")\n  \n  # --- Parameters for Current Tick ---\n  TICK = 219\n  DEPTH = 1\n  NAME_LEN = 64\n  MEASUREMENT_INDEX = 2 # Third measurement\n  PAYLOAD_SIZE = 16\n  BASE_DIR = \"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/logosIII\"\n  RUN_ID = \"path_mult_logosIII\"\n  # ---\n\n  print(f\"Executing measurement write for Tick {TICK}: Cell({DEPTH},{NAME_LEN}), Measurement {MEASUREMENT_INDEX + 1}/3.\")\n\n  # Generate the unique file path for this measurement\n  target_path = make_path(\n      run_id=RUN_ID,\n      depth=DEPTH,\n      name_len=NAME_LEN,\n      idx=MEASUREMENT_INDEX,\n      base_dir=BASE_DIR,\n      extension=\"txt\"\n  )\n  print(f\"Target path: {target_path}\")\n\n  # Perform a single 16B overwrite\n  payload = 'M' * PAYLOAD_SIZE\n  write_files([{'path': target_path, 'content': payload, 'mode': 'overwrite'}])\n\n  print(\"\
    Final measurement write for Block 1 complete.\")\n```"
