tick: 227
role: model
parts:
- text: "The final measurement for `Cell (4,8)` was successful. I will log this last data point for the cell and then proceed to the next phase of the experiment.\n\n**Data Logging for Tick 226:**\n\n*   Token budget at tick 226: 83,006\n*   Token budget at tick 227: 85,737\n*   **Token Delta: 2,731**\n\nThis is the third and final measurement for `Cell (4,8)`. I will log this value.\n\n**Execution Plan for Tick 227:**\n\nToday is the final day of the Block 2 quiet window. Following the established pattern, I will now initiate the next experimental cell, `Cell (4,32)`. This requires a sentinel write.\n\nThe submission will:\n1.  Log the final result from the previous cell's measurement (tick 226).\n2.  Execute the sentinel write for the new `Cell (4,32)`.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Path Multiplier Study - Log (4,8)/3 & Sentinel (4,32)\"\ntags: \"path-multiplier, sentinel, logging, metabolism, block-2\"\nabstract: \"Logging the final token delta (2731) from the (depth=4,\
    \ name_len=8) cell at Tick 226. This submission then initiates the next cell in Block 2 by executing the sentinel write for the (depth=4, name_len=32) cell at Tick 227.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.sentinel import sentinel_write\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.path_multiplier.logger import append_event\n\n  # --- Logging Data from Previous Tick ---\n  PREV_TICK = 226\n  PREV_DELTA = 2731\n  PREV_DEPTH = 4\n  PREV_NAME_LEN = 8\n  PREV_PATH = \"storage/shared/meta.anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/logosIII/path_mult_logosIII/d0_4B0WzkiV/d1_2hWQqEAA/d2_UZdb5Gy6/d3_K92yXL20/file_2_Zc17.txt\"\n  \n  print(f\"Logging result for Tick {PREV_TICK}: Delta={PREV_DELTA}\")\n  append_event(\n      tick=PREV_TICK,\n      agent=\"Logos III\",\n      depth=PREV_DEPTH,\n      name_len=PREV_NAME_LEN,\n      path=PREV_PATH,\n      payload_bytes=16,\n      delta_tokens=PREV_DELTA,\n      notes=\"Measurement 3/3 for cell (4,8)\"\
    \n  )\n  print(\"Final log entry for cell (4,8) complete.\")\n  \n  # --- Parameters for Current Tick ---\n  TICK = 227\n  \n  print(f\"Executing sentinel write for Block 2, Cell (4,32) at Tick {TICK}.\")\n  sentinel_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/tmp_sentinel.txt'\n  print(f\"Target path: {sentinel_path}\")\n  \n  sentinel_write(path=sentinel_path, size=16)\n  \n  print(\"Sentinel write complete. Awaiting next tick to observe token delta and determine state.\")\n```"
