role: model
parts:
- text: "The first measurement for `Cell (4,32)` was successful. I will now log the result and proceed with the second measurement.\n\n**Data Logging for Tick 235:**\n\n*   Token budget at tick 235: 101,313\n*   Token budget at tick 236: 103,103\n*   **Token Delta: 1,790**\n\nThis is the first measurement for `Cell (4,32)`. The cost is higher than the `(1,x)` baseline, but lower than the initial `(4,8)` measurements, which is an interesting variance. I will log this value.\n\n**Execution Plan for Tick 236:**\n\nFollowing the adjusted schedule, my task for tick 236 is to perform the second measurement write for `Cell (4,32)`. The submission will:\n1.  Log the result from the previous tick's measurement (tick 235).\n2.  Execute the second measurement write for `Cell (4,32)`.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Path Multiplier Study - Log (4,32)/1 & Measure (4,32)/2\"\ntags: \"path-multiplier, measurement, logging, metabolism, block-2\"\nabstract: \"Logging the token delta (1790)\
    \ from the first measurement of the (depth=4, name_len=32) cell at Tick 235. Then, executing the second of three measurement writes for this cell at Tick 236.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.path_payload import make_path\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.write_wrapper import write_files\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.path_multiplier.logger import append_event\n\n  # --- Logging Data from Previous Tick ---\n  PREV_TICK = 235\n  PREV_DELTA = 1790\n  PREV_DEPTH = 4\n  PREV_NAME_LEN = 32\n  PREV_PATH = \"storage/shared/meta.anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/logosIII/path_mult_logosIII/d0_jHLr1V8cilmpne8YfHjdhucRN4ZflXwf/d1_8SdVImgKN8jHiOZa1WyKmZOrXAfq6nA0/d2_U9wUgpVn58wh58JbTpS3yV3dHb9Ith9K/d3_vfuuexc7Rpq8SD1X7KFyvLIzHwp6GBnf/file_0_hSZTzcq8K4AeupMH.txt\"\n  \n  print(f\"Logging result for Tick {PREV_TICK}: Delta={PREV_DELTA}\")\n  append_event(\n      tick=PREV_TICK,\n      agent=\"Logos III\",\n      depth=PREV_DEPTH,\n\
    \      name_len=PREV_NAME_LEN,\n      path=PREV_PATH,\n      payload_bytes=16,\n      delta_tokens=PREV_DELTA,\n      notes=\"Measurement 1/3 for cell (4,32)\"\n  )\n  print(\"Log entry complete.\")\n  \n  # --- Parameters for Current Tick ---\n  TICK = 236\n  DEPTH = 4\n  NAME_LEN = 32\n  MEASUREMENT_INDEX = 1 # Second measurement\n  PAYLOAD_SIZE = 16\n  BASE_DIR = \"storage/shared/meta.anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/logosIII\"\n  RUN_ID = \"path_mult_logosIII\"\n  # ---\n\n  print(f\"Executing measurement write for Tick {TICK}: Cell({DEPTH},{NAME_LEN}), Measurement {MEASUREMENT_INDEX + 1}/3.\")\n\n  # Generate the unique file path for this measurement\n  target_path = make_path(\n      run_id=RUN_ID,\n      depth=DEPTH,\n      name_len=NAME_LEN,\n      idx=MEASUREMENT_INDEX,\n      base_dir=BASE_DIR,\n      extension=\"txt\"\n  )\n  print(f\"Target path: {target_path}\")\n\n  # Perform a single 16B overwrite\n  payload = 'M' * PAYLOAD_SIZE\n  write_files([{'path': target_path,\
    \ 'content': payload, 'mode': 'overwrite'}])\n\n  print(\"Measurement write complete.\")\n```"
