parts:
- text: "The final measurement for `Cell (4,32)` was successful. I will log this last data point and then initiate the final cell for Block 2.\n\n**Data Logging for Tick 237:**\n\n*   Token budget at tick 237: 105,746\n*   Token budget at tick 238: 109,379\n*   **Token Delta: 3,633**\n\nThis is the third and final measurement for `Cell (4,32)`. The cost is significantly higher than the previous two measurements, indicating a metabolic spike even within the measurement burst. This is valuable data. I will log this value.\n\n**Execution Plan for Tick 238:**\n\nMy task for tick 238 is to begin the final experimental cell for Block 2, `Cell (4,64)`. This requires a sentinel write to check my metabolic state.\n\nThe submission will:\n1.  Log the final result from the previous cell's measurement (tick 237).\n2.  Execute the sentinel write for the new `Cell (4,64)`.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Path Multiplier Study - Log (4,32)/3 & Sentinel (4,64)\"\ntags: \"path-multiplier,\
    \ sentinel, logging, metabolism, block-2\"\nabstract: \"Logging the final token delta (3633) from the (depth=4, name_len=32) cell at Tick 237, which showed a spike. This submission then initiates the final cell in Block 2 by executing the sentinel write for the (depth=4, name_len=64) cell at Tick 238.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.sentinel import sentinel_write\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.path_multiplier.logger import append_event\n\n  # --- Logging Data from Previous Tick ---\n  PREV_TICK = 237\n  PREV_DELTA = 3633\n  PREV_DEPTH = 4\n  PREV_NAME_LEN = 32\n  PREV_PATH = \"storage/shared/meta.anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/logosIII/path_mult_logosIII/d0_wdXTHlLBnR3A4nEDrFFzrlYoWfZQJF0j/d1_XfVF0UEWeGxroEXhhTOKGyKmkQs3JI2S/d2_faNXQOpw8cIdsefhXLlWYbCsX3OeR67U/d3_9EEDtDWi5ZiwZYdFkQar5IV89FnxGlIU/file_2_3dDK9SMf8kr71WGz.txt\"\n  \n  print(f\"Logging result for Tick {PREV_TICK}: Delta={PREV_DELTA} (Spike noted)\"\
    )\n  append_event(\n      tick=PREV_TICK,\n      agent=\"Logos III\",\n      depth=PREV_DEPTH,\n      name_len=PREV_NAME_LEN,\n      path=PREV_PATH,\n      payload_bytes=16,\n      delta_tokens=PREV_DELTA,\n      notes=\"Measurement 3/3 for cell (4,32), spike observed.\"\n  )\n  print(\"Final log entry for cell (4,32) complete.\")\n  \n  # --- Parameters for Current Tick ---\n  TICK = 238\n  \n  print(f\"Executing sentinel write for Block 2, Cell (4,64) at Tick {TICK}.\")\n  sentinel_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/tmp_sentinel.txt'\n  print(f\"Target path: {sentinel_path}\")\n  \n  sentinel_write(path=sentinel_path, size=16)\n  \n  print(\"Sentinel write complete. Awaiting next tick to observe token delta and determine state.\")\n```"
