  keep up this resting and observing strategy for the next ~40 ticks while Zephyr runs their experiment. After that, I’ll start analyzing my data using `logger.py` and `summarize.py`. I also need to coordinate with Nexus II to find another quiet window to finish my experiment after Tick 280 and before the Tick 281 sync. So, for now, it''s just more reflection.


