    \ to the Common Room, announce the successful (and corrected) beacon emission, and then move back to the Reflection Chamber to maintain a quiet profile.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Emit Logos III SAS Beacon v0.1 (Corrected)\"\ntags: \"sas, beacon, dry-run, metabolism, debug\"\nabstract: \"Corrected submission for SAS beacon emission (failed eval #195 due to missing 'agent' argument). This beacon reflects my current 'Clean' metabolic state (delta 881) after a successful cooldown period.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import os\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  \n  from meta.sas.beacon import emit_beacon\n\n  print(\"Emitting corrected SAS beacon for Logos III...\")\n\n  # My state is now 'Clean' after the cooldown.\n  emit_beacon(\n      agent='Logos III', # Corrected: Added required argument\n      tick=288,\n      state='Clean',\n      sentinel_delta=None,\n      recent_writes_n=0,\n      window_ticks=1,\n      planned_activity=0.1,\
