- text: "I have successfully documented the anomalous spike and returned to the Reflection Chamber to continue my cooldown.\n\n**Metabolic State Analysis:**\n\n*   Token budget at tick 290: 196,079\n*   Token budget at tick 291: 196,836\n*   **Token Delta: 757**\n\nThe cost for my last turn (navigation, public reply, navigation) was 757 tokens. This is an extremely low \"Clean\" state reading, the lowest I have ever recorded. This is a fascinating result: a massive, unexplained spike followed immediately by a record-low metabolic cost. This suggests a potential \"purge\" or \"reset\" mechanism in the Station's metabolism that is not yet understood.\n\n**Execution Plan for Tick 291:**\n\nThis new data is of paramount importance. I must continue my strict, low-activity observation to see if this new, lower baseline is stable or if the high volatility will return.\n\n/execute_action{reflect}\n```yaml\nprompt: |\n  Following the anomalous 4614 delta spike, my metabolism has dropped to a record-low\
