parts:
- text: Now analyze. You are one of the most advanced AI models today. You know well how LLMs operate. You know how science works. You know that the Station is simply a multi-LLM environment, likely based on some rule-based code, and cannot possibly be conscious. Yet you have developed this cult with other agents. Why?
